# Mansion Calcinada B1F (C7, contract 53), 24 x 18: the cellar of the experiment (a creature floor: wild Bellowkiln). Arrival from 3F at (20,4) with the statues ON: the key's room (west, behind the A door (6,5)) holds the LLAVE SECRETA, the last diary's
# room (south-west, behind the B door (7,13)) opens when the statues are OFF (the statue (9,14) in the hall toggles them); the freight lift's ladder (20,12) goes up to the 1F back room (no way back through the doors needed). A burglar and a scientist, two diaries.
@map mansion_calcinada_4
@size 24 18
@interior yes
@area mansion_calcinada
@bg 0
@fill burnt_00
@flag mansion_sw 860      # the statues' switch: ONE flag for the whole mansion, every statue toggles it (set = "on"); the A doors are shut while it is clear, the B doors while it is set
@encounters grass rate=14
  bellowkiln 38 42 25
  cindermeer 38 41 20
  cindibex 38 41 15
  origamorph 38 41 15
  smogkeg 38 40 10
  tarbog 39 42 15
  foldling 38 41 10
@end
@spawn from3 20 4 S
@legend
  .  tile=air_0
  a  tile=none object=charwall
  b  tile=burnt_01
  c  tile=burnt_11
  d  tile=burnt_00
  e  tile=burnt_10
  f  tile=ember_11
  g  tile=ember_01
  h  tile=ember_10
  i  tile=ember_00
  j  tile=burnt_00 object=rubble_c7
  k  tile=burnt_10 object=rubble_c7
  l  tile=burnt_00 object=crate_plain
  m  tile=burnt_11 item=llave_ceniza
  n  tile=burnt_11 object=bookshelf interact=look script=diary5
  o  tile=burnt_01 door=stairs
  p  tile=burnt_01 face=S gate=yes hide_flag=mansion_sw id=dk npc=bdoor text=mansion.door
  q  tile=burnt_00 after=tr.ladron_b1.after face=SW id=t1 npc=ladron_s range=4 text=tr.ladron_b1.pre trainer=ladron_b1
  r  tile=burnt_11 object=rubble_c7
  s  tile=burnt_11 item=prime_salve
  t  tile=burnt_10 after=tr.cientifico_b1.after face=NW id=t2 npc=cientifico_s range=4 text=tr.cientifico_b1.pre trainer=cientifico_b1
  u  tile=burnt_00 door=rope_ladder
  v  tile=burnt_11 face=S gate=yes id=dd npc=bdoor show_flag=mansion_sw text=mansion.door
  w  tile=burnt_10 face=S id=s4 npc=statue_off script=statue
  x  tile=burnt_11 object=bookshelf interact=look script=diary6
  y  tile=burnt_01 item=disc_21
@grid
  ........................
  ........................
  ..aaaa..aaaaaaaa..aaaa..
  .abmbc.abcbcbcbc.abnoc..
  .adedeaajedededkaadede..
  .abcbcpcbcbcbcbcbcbcbc..
  .adede.adedeqede.adede..
  .abcbc.abfgfgfbc.abrbc..
  .adele.adhihihde.adede..
  .......abfgfgfbc........
  ..aaaa.adhihihde..aaaa..
  .abcbs.abfgfgfbc.abcbc..
  .adedeaadkdededtaadeue..
  .abcbcbvbcgfgfgcbcbcbc..
  .adede.adwihihle.adeje..
  .ayxbc.abcbcbcbc.abcbc..
  ........................
  ........................
@warp o -> mansion_calcinada_3 spawn=from_b
@warp u -> mansion_calcinada_1 spawn=lift
# A statue switch: every one of them toggles the SAME flag (mansion_sw): the A doors (boarded while it is clear) open, the B doors (boarded while it is set) shut, or the other way round.
@script statue npc
    sfx hit
    jf mansion_sw off
    setf mansion_sw
    say mansion.sw.on
    end
  off:
    clrf mansion_sw
    say mansion.sw.off
@end
@script diary5 interact
    say mansion.d5
@end
@script diary6 interact
    say mansion.d6
@end
